  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing climate resilience: Area C solar power for Gaza and West Bank and regional water security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overall objective: &lt;/strong&gt;Increased regional cooperation and agreement on joint action on climate, energy, and human security&lt;strong&gt;. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific objectives: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1)&lt;/strong&gt; There is increased awareness and political will of key national and international decision makers on water security as central to national and regional security.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2) &lt;/strong&gt; An evidence base is created for implementation of rapid response measures to build climate resilience for Palestinians in Area C of the West Bank, the Jordan Valley, and Gaza.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outputs: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SO 1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 1.1:&lt;/strong&gt; Through high-level advocacy initiatives, international and regional stakeholders demonstrate increased awareness and engagement on climate and water security issues as a fundamental part of regional security.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 1.2: &lt;/strong&gt;Through national advocacy initiatives, key national stakeholders demonstrate increased awareness of water security issues and potential response measures as a fundamental part of national security.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SO 2&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 2.1: &lt;/strong&gt;Evidence-based local initiatives are identified through the design of five concept notes developed through an inclusive consultation process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 2.2: &lt;/strong&gt;Small-scale pilot projects are conducted in local communities following the mobilisation of funds from key private and public stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
